 the Australian Cinematographers Society since 1975 and the American Society of Cinematographers since 2004.\nBoyd served as cinematographer for Tender Mercies, a 1983 film about an alcoholic country singer played by Robert Duvall. Boyd largely utilized available light to give the film a natural feeling which director Bruce Beresford said was crucial to the movie. Actress Tess Harper said Boyd was so quiet during filming that he mostly used only three words: \"Yeah, right and sure.\"For his work on the 2003 film Master and Commander: The Far Side of the World, Boyd won the Academy Award for Best Cinematography. In 2021, he was appointed an Officer of the Order of Australia for \"distinguished service to the visual arts as a cinematographer of Australian feature films and television productions\" in the Queen's Birthday Honours.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2023-08-01T16:57:18.601278+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 5093, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russell_Boyd"}], "uuid": "fed0aeab-d6b3-4d5a-b2db-a8078e0e027c", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "32123", "external_references": [{"id": 26928, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q260963"}, {"id": 31349, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "86925126"}, {"id": 31350, "source": {"name": "LOC Auth", "slug": "loc-auth"}, "source_identifier": "no2003059840"}, {"id": 31351, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-no2003059840"}], "date_modified": "2023-08-01T16:57:18.625437+10:00"}, {"id": 74418, "name": "Larry Gosnell", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2348881, "title": "The Flower and the hive", "work_id": 78053, "role": "co-director", "role_id": 959, "is_primary": true}, {"id": 2318565, "title": "Supermarkets and the farmer", "work_id": 73379, "role": "director", "role_id": 938, "is_primary": true}, {"id": 2317392, "title": "Sunflowers", "work_id": 87213